Why non-commercial
------------------
The weights were fine-tuned on a combination of academic datasets whose
upstream licenses include NonCommercial and/or research-only clauses. To
propagate those restrictions in good faith, CyberPuppy weights inherit the
most restrictive upstream term (NonCommercial). Commercial users who want
a clean commercial variant should retrain on Apache-2.0-only sources
(e.g. COLD alone plus their own permissioned data); the CyberPuppy team
offers this as a paid consulting service — see `docs/adr/0001-cyberpuppy-2026-upgrade.md` §3.8.

